an> <span begin="01:41.283" end="01:41.439">know</span> <span begin="01:41.439" end="01:41.569">that</span> <span begin="01:41.569" end="01:41.904">it's</span> <span begin="01:41.904" end="01:42.504">mine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道这是属于我的</span></p><p begin="01:50.803" end="01:52.454" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:50.803" end="01:50.976">I</span> <span begin="01:50.976" end="01:51.105">know</span> <span begin="01:51.105" end="01:51.242">that</span> <span begin="01:51.242" end="01:51.578">it's</span> <span begin="01:51.578" end="01:52.454">mine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道这是属于我的</span></p><p begin="01:55.640" end="01:59.754" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:55.640" end="01:55.830">I</span> <span begin="01:55.830" end="01:55.933">know</span> <span begin="01:55.933" end="01:56.100">that</span> <span begin="01:56.100" end="01:56.395">it's</span> <span begin="01:56.395" end="01:57.031">mine,</span> <span begin="01:57.611" end="01:58.259">mine,</span> <span begin="01:58.828" end="01:59.754">mine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道这是属于我的，我的，我的</span></p><p begin="02:02.628" end="02:04.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:02.628" end="02:03.235">Facing</span> <span begin="02:03.235" end="02:03.608">the</span> <span begin="02:03.608" end="02:04.750">change</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">面对朝云暮雨的日子</span></p><p begin="02:05.178" end="02:07.324" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:05.178" end="02:05.453">But</span> <span begin="02:05.453" end="02:05.793">it's</span> <span begin="02:05.793" end="02:06.076">still</span> <span begin="02:06.076" end="02:06.630">tough</span> <span begin="02:06.630" end="02:06.860">to</span> <span begin="02:06.860" end="02:07.324">see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让人很难去看清事物的本质</span></p><p begin="02:07.610" end="02:10.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:07.610" end="02:07.748">At</span> <span begin="02:07.748" end="02:08.230">first</span> <span begin="02:08.230" end="02:08.383">I</span> <span begin="02:08.383" end="02:08.850">fought</span> <span begin="02:08.850" end="02:09.140">it</span> <span begin="02:09.140" end="02:09.598">all</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:09.717" end="02:10.730"><span begin="02:09.717" end="02:10.077">(Fought</span> <span begin="02:10.077" end="02:10.327">it</span> <span begin="02:10.327" end="02:10.730">all)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">抵抗一切</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">最初我盲目地抵抗一切</span></p><p begin="02:10.307" end="02:12.434" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:10.307" end="02:10.557">I</span> <span begin="02:10.557" end="02:10.734">was</span> <span begin="02:10.734" end="02:11.245">so</span> <span begin="02:11.546" end="02:12.434">mean</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那时的我太刻薄了</span></p><p begin="02:12.434" end="02:13.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:12.434" end="02:12.610">I'm</span> <span begin="02:12.610" end="02:13.029">still</span> <span begin="02:13.029" end="02:13.987">unsure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直到现在我也不确定</span></p><p begin="02:14.837" end="02:17.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:14.837" end="02:15.156">How</span> <span begin="02:15.156" end="02:15.488">it's</span> <span begin="02:15.488" end="02:16.401">supposed</span> <span begin="02:16.401" end="02:16.700">to</span> <span begin="02:16.700" end="02:17.070">be?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">事情本应该是什么样子？</span></p><p begin="02:17.308" end="02:22.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:17.308" end="02:17.606">I'm</span> <span begin="02:17.606" end="02:18.218">taking</span> <span begin="02:18.218" end="02:19.441">everyday</span> <span begin="02:19.441" end="02:19.995">now</span> <span begin="02:19.995" end="02:20.364">by</span> <span begin="02:20.364" end="02:20.629">the</span> <span begin="02:20.629" end="02:20.981">skin</span> <span begin="02:20.981" end="02:21.241">of</span> <span begin="02:21.241" end="02:21.506">my</span> <span begin="02:21.506" end="02:22.010">teeth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在的我每一件事都会切身去寻找 去体会</span></p><p begin="02:22.172" end="02:23.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:22.172" end="02:22.719">Until</span> <span begin="02:22.719" end="02:23.094">I</span> <span begin="02:23.094" end="02:23.570">learn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直到我领悟</span></p><p begin="02:24.144" end="02:29.151" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:24.144" end="02:24.326">I'm</span> <span begin="02:24.326" end="02:24.653">holding</span> <span begin="02:24.653" end="02:24.864">on</span> <span begin="02:24.864" end="02:25.054">to</span> <span begin="02:25.054" end="02:25.339">all</span> <span begin="02:25.339" end="02:25.479">the</span> <span begin="02:25.479" end="02:26.088">pieces</span> <span begin="02:26.088" end="02:26.538">of</span> <span begin="02:26.538" end="02:26.717">my</span> <span begin="02:26.717" end="02:27.162">heart's</span> <span begin="02:27.162" end="02:27.930">debris</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:27.574" end="02:29.151"><span begin="02:27.574" end="02:27.754">(Of</span> <span begin="02:27.754" end="02:27.923">my</span> <span begin="02:27.923" end="02:28.450">heart's</span> <span begin="02:28.450" end="02:29.151">debris)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我那支离破碎的心</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">咬紧牙关 握紧我那支离破碎的心</span></p><p begin="02:29.151" end="02:30.952" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:29.151" end="02:29.592">'Til</span> <span begin="02:29.592" end="02:29.993">it's</span> <span begin="02:29.993" end="02:30.952">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直到最后一刻</span></p><p begin="02:32.165" end="02:38.651" tt